				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Interactive playground for the **Gt4Security** project — OSV.dev, NVD, cross-source queries.\n\nEvery Pharo snippet below is live: hit **Do it and inspect** (or ⌘⇧G) to run it and open the result in the inspector. The page is organized chronologically by phase so you can trace how the API evolved, but the later cells are the ones you'll use day-to-day (Phase 3's cross-source query in cells 16-18 is the main one).\n\nRelated pages:\n- {{gtPage:Gt4Security — Project Overview|db=ay32zeq1d68a2o5v8gd9epf14}}\n- {{gtPage:Gt4Security — Implementation Plan|db=ay32zeq1d68a2o5v8gd9epf14}}\n- {{gtPage:Gt4Security — CVE Source Comparison|db=ay32zeq1d68a2o5v8gd9epf14}}\n\nKey classes: {{gtClass:Gt4SecurityOsvClient}}, {{gtClass:Gt4SecurityNvdClient}}, {{gtClass:Gt4SecurityVulnerability}}, {{gtClass:Gt4SecurityVulnerabilityGroup}}, {{gtClass:Gt4SecurityQuery}}.\n\nContents:\n- **Phase 1 — OSV (Android)**, cells 1-7\n- **Phase 2 — NVD (iOS / devices)**, cells 8-14\n- **Phase 3 — Group + cross-source query**, cells 15-19"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
