				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## 2. Query Android kernel CVEs\n\nPulls every CVE OSV has for the Android Linux kernel package (`:linux_kernel:`). Last run returned **229** vulnerabilities. Each result is a live `Gt4SecurityVulnerability` with its own set of views — click through to one and try the **Summary**, **Affected**, **References**, and **Raw JSON** tabs."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
