				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## 4. Query a Maven library bundled in Android apps\n\nOSV covers Maven, so you can query libraries you know are bundled into Android apps. OkHttp is a classic — it ships inside most modern Android apps via Gradle."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
