				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## 7. Run the gtExamples directly\n\nThe four `<gtExample>` methods in {{gtClass:Gt4SecurityOsvExamples}} are runnable from the inspector's **Examples** view, but you can also invoke them from a playground. All four pass against live OSV."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
