				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "---\n\n# Phase 2 — NVD (iOS / Apple / device firmware)\n\n{{gtClass:Gt4SecurityNvdClient}} talks to `services.nvd.nist.gov/rest/json/cves/2.0`. It's rate-limited to **6 seconds between calls** without an API key (or 1 second with one — grab a free key at https://nvd.nist.gov/developers/request-an-api-key and use `Gt4SecurityNvdClient withApiKey: 'xxx'`).\n\nThe rate limiter is **per-client-instance**. Fresh clients start with no delay; subsequent calls on the same client respect the limit. Each of the query cells below creates its own client on purpose, so they all run snappy.\n\n## 8. Look up a specific iOS / Safari CVE by id\n\nCVE-2024-23222 is a well-known WebKit type-confusion bug — base score 8.8 HIGH, exploited in the wild."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-04-11T22:51:15.483336-04:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-04-11T22:51:15.483336-04:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "3tJoasSRRv+sFwH4fBaUaA=="
				},
				"code" : "Gt4SecurityNvdClient new cveById: 'CVE-2024-23222'"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
