				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## 14. Latest Apple iOS CVEs (new disclosures, last 90 days)\n\nA \"new disclosures\" feed for iPhone OS. Combines `virtualMatchString` + `pubStartDate` in a single NVD v2 call, then sorts client-side by `published` descending (NVD v2 has **no server-side sort** — default order is ascending by published, confirmed against the spec at `nvd.nist.gov/developers/vulnerabilities`).\n\nFor \"anything that changed recently\" (re-scored, re-described, newly exploited), use the `modifiedSince:` variant instead — it hits `lastModStartDate` and sorts by `modified` desc."
			},
