				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "# Phase 3 — Group + cross-source query\n\nEvery client query now returns a {{gtClass:Gt4SecurityVulnerabilityGroup}} (uses `TGtGroupWithItems`). That gives you a first-class inspectable collection with type-preserving filters (`highSeverity`, `ecosystem:`, `matching:`, ...) and custom views (**Summary**, **By ecosystem**, **By severity**, **Vulnerabilities**).\n\n{{gtClass:Gt4SecurityQuery}} is the fluent cross-source builder — it fans out to NVD + OSV, dedupes by id/alias, applies post-filters, and returns a single group.\n\n## 15. Same Android kernel query as cell #2, but now inspectable as a group\n\nYou'll see the new views in the inspector tabs. `select:` is type-preserving — chain as many filters as you want."
			},
