					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## 16. Cross-source mobile query — iOS + Android kernel, published in last 90 days\n\nOne call, two sources, deduped, inspected as one group. Open the **Summary** view for the rollup, **By ecosystem** for the Android / (CPE-based) split (real OSV ecosystems plus a `(CPE-based)` bucket for NVD-sourced vulns), **By CPE vendor** for the useful breakdown of CPE-based rows (apple / cisco / …), **Vulnerabilities** for the full sorted list."
