					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## 17. Mobile-only shortcut + severity floor\n\n`mobileOnly` populates the query with iOS (NVD CPE) + two common Android packages. `severityAtLeast:` is a post-filter that drops anything below a given numeric CVSS baseScore."
			},
			{
