				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## 25. CWE classifications\n\nOSV GHSA entries carry CWE ids under `database_specific.cwe_ids`; NVD carries them in `weaknesses[]`. Both surface as a {{gtClass:Gt4SecurityCweGroup}} on the vuln. Click a CWE row → **Open MITRE CWE page** toolbar button jumps to https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/NNN.html."
			},
