				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## 26. Severity as a first-class object\n\n`vuln severity primary` returns a {{gtClass:Gt4SecuritySeverity}}. It knows its type (CVSS_V3.1 / V4 / etc.), vector string, and computes the CVSS score lazily via {{gtMethod:Gt4SecuritySeverity>>#cvssVector}} even when NVD didn't provide a numeric baseScore."
