				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## 27. Alias lookup — navigate the cross-reference graph\n\nEach alias on a vuln is a {{gtClass:Gt4SecurityAlias}} object. Click a row in the Aliases view → the send handler calls OSV `vulnerabilityById:` with the alias id and spawns the related record. This lets you traverse CVE → GHSA → MAL → etc. in the inspector."
