				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## 28. Stress-check: inspect the Raw view\n\nEvery structured ivar should be a domain group, not a raw collection. This snippet just returns a live NVD vuln — open the **Raw** tab and verify `affected`, `references`, `severity`, `cwes`, `aliases`, `credits` all read as `a Gt4SecurityXxxGroup`, never `an Array [N items] (a Dictionary...)`. `cisaKev` should be either nil or `a Gt4SecurityCisaKev`."
			},
